cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Bank Register Ontology (BRO)"
message: "If you use this ontology or its findings, please cite it."
type: dataset
version: 0.2.0
authors:
  - given-names: Fabio
    family-names: Rovai
    email: fabio@thetesseractacademy.com
    affiliation: "Kampakis and Co Ltd, trading as The Tesseract Academy"
repository-code: "https://github.com/fabio-rovai/bank-register-ontology"
abstract: >-
  An open OWL 2 ontology, SKOS registries and SHACL governance layer for the
  entity fabric and regulatory-reporting concept fabric of US banking, built
  against the FDIC BankFind register, the GLEIF golden copy and the Federal
  Reserve MDRM data dictionary.
keywords:
  - ontology
  - knowledge graph
  - banking
  - regulatory reporting
  - legal entity identifier
  - data governance
